=== agent-liveness + guard-agent-state-claims ===

--- A. the resolver's verdicts, on real worktrees and real pids ---
  PASS  A1 locked worktree + LIVE pid -> ALIVE
  PASS  A2 locked worktree + DEAD pid (stale lock) -> NOT-ALIVE
  PASS  A3 registered but UNLOCKED -> NOT-ALIVE
  PASS  A4 no registered worktree -> NOT-ALIVE
  PASS  A5 locked but the lock line carries NO pid -> INDETERMINATE (a held lock this cannot attribute is never read as death)
  PASS  A5b locked with an EMPTY reason (the measured artifact) -> INDETERMINATE, not NOT-ALIVE
  PASS  A5c a lock naming a RUNNING pid still reads ALIVE (the inversion above is about attribution, not about locks)
  PASS  A6 a worktree PATH resolves the same as its id

--- B. INDETERMINATE is a real outcome, never collapsed ---
  PASS  B1 git cannot be queried -> INDETERMINATE (not NOT-ALIVE)
  PASS  B2 the shell lib with no resolver -> INDETERMINATE, never a guess

--- C. the remover and the library AGREE ---
