  PASS  C NOT-ALIVE (stale lock) -> remover proceeds — library says NOT-ALIVE, remover exits 0 (agreed)
  PASS  C NOT-ALIVE (unlocked)   -> remover proceeds — library says NOT-ALIVE, remover exits 0 (agreed)

